&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience producing B2B marketing events or conferences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working at a SaaS or technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting hybrid or livestreamed events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI tools that improve event planning, production, or content creation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event platforms (e.g. Cvent, Splash, Bizzabo, Goldcast, or similar)&lt;/li&gt;
