&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently pursuing a Bachelor&#39;s degree in Business, Sales, Technology, or a related field or early in your career with less than 2 years of professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging with prospects via email and phone&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, with French or German preferred (Dublin only)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using tools such as LinkedIn and Google Workspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive and self-motivated, with the ability to manage tasks independently with light guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious about technology, AI, sales, and customer experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and strong follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to build a long-term career in sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
