&lt;li&gt;Able to prototype and ship software fast, while maintaining a high bar on quality and the focus on business goals and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient using and writing REST APIs to integrate systems effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator. Can easily talk to engineers and non-technical audiences about the same topics at different altitudes, and different levels of detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willing to travel and work on-site with customers to build strong relationships and deeply understand their needs.&lt;/li&gt;
